We have conducted system Audit and found the observation among key pressing issue that represented by below case study summary. I would appreciate for your technical knowledge how it happened and mitigation; 
 1.1 Introduction; 
 The business is Fuel distribution (downstream), there are customers which store their imported fuel into the fuel tanks , i.e, the service is called Hospitality service, they are being charged in metric cube per month. 
 1.2 Summary of observation; 
 Several customers came to load their fuel by trucks , the service provider (Fuel terminal storage owner) usually generate sales loading order at zero cost by team of sales and marketing, then, they print the sales order, they give to operation team , Gantry loading point, then, fuel loaded into trucks and despatched. 
 2.1 Observation; 
 When conducted system audit it came to our attention that various case of sales order numbers of hospitality customers were swapped with sales order for non-hospitality customers (fuel customers). When you pick sales order from Gantry report (loading register) and punch into SAP Sales order window (master), the details of customer differ, product details differ, truck details differs between Gantry report and SAP Sales order window. When tracing to the change log, opening ''tools'' opening Business partner history, it shows among changed field is the sales order number changed and the originally order was closed manually. 
 Kindly , assist to understand this case
